# Use the /* form, not experiments/: only /* permits re-including a subpath
# later with a negation such as !experiments/downstream_ocr
experiments/*
# Exception: the PAGE-XML vs PAGE-XML evaluation metrics (TextEdit,
# Devanagari-relaxed TextEdit, Page CER, object and pixel layout metrics) and
# the vendored OmniDocBench v1.5 code they depend on. This is the import
# closure of experiments/downstream_ocr/metrics.py; the rest of the harness
# (runners, CLI, VLM acquisition, reporting, GNN fine-tuning) stays local.
# See METRICS.md. Each directory is re-included before its own contents are
# filtered, because git cannot re-include a file whose parent is excluded.
!experiments/downstream_ocr/
experiments/downstream_ocr/*
!experiments/downstream_ocr/__init__.py
!experiments/downstream_ocr/metrics.py
!experiments/downstream_ocr/pagexml.py
!experiments/downstream_ocr/text.py
!experiments/downstream_ocr/devanagari_textedit.py
!experiments/downstream_ocr/dataset/
!experiments/downstream_ocr/omnidocbench_v1_5/
!experiments/downstream_ocr/configs/
experiments/downstream_ocr/configs/*
!experiments/downstream_ocr/configs/pagexml_textedit.yaml
!experiments/downstream_ocr/tests/
experiments/downstream_ocr/tests/*
!experiments/downstream_ocr/tests/__init__.py
!experiments/downstream_ocr/tests/test_pagexml_textedit.py
newar_sanskrit_dataset/*

